Revision history for cloudflare

0.11  2026-05-19
      - fix the released docs and ticket records to use dashboard docker compose up -d cloudflare

0.10  2026-05-19
      - build the startup PAR binary on perl:5.36 so the shipped runtime stays glibc-compatible with cloudflare/cloudflared:latest on older hosts
      - record a remote dashboard docker compose proof against a real installed-skill environment

0.09  2026-05-19
      - copy the required PAR libcrypt runtime library into the final cloudflared image
      - run the compose service as root so the startup binary can populate /etc/cloudflared
      - add a real startup smoke check to the release gate so runtime linker failures are caught

0.08  2026-05-19
      - remove the redundant image tag from the cloudflare compose build service

0.07  2026-05-19
      - replace the mounted shell startup wrapper with a Perl startup binary built by a multi-stage Dockerfile

0.06  2026-05-19
      - change the shipped compose command to --post-quantum tunnel run ${CLOUDFLARE_DOMAIN_ID}

0.05  2026-05-19
      - switch the startup wrapper mount to ${cloudflare_DDDC}/startup

0.04  2026-05-19
      - add the shipped /opt/startup cloudflared wrapper and UUID compose environment
      - align the runtime on /etc/cloudflared config and credential paths

0.03  2026-05-19
      - switch the shipped cloudflare compose service to CLOUDFLARE_DOMAIN_ID
      - align skill .env version with the released changelog and add a version gate test

0.02  2026-05-19
      - move the shipped compose asset to config/docker/cloudflare/compose.yml

0.01  2026-05-19
      - bootstrap the Cloudflare Tunnel skill with login, create, uuid, and dns commands
      - ship Docker compose runtime config for the cloudflare service
      - add Docker-tested project .env management and tunnel config generation
